From 6917d860644959e49c02a6428afe8bf7e0746471 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:49:07 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 27/75] PlaitOS: import NetworkTraffic and LineageStatusBarItem
 from lineage-sdk

Both live in lineage-sdk (org.lineageos.internal.statusbar), which PlaitOS
doesn't ship; bring them into SystemUI as com.android.systemui.statusbar with
their resources (strings, dimens, arrow drawables). Code unchanged apart from
the package and R import; the settings move to plain keys in the adapt commit.

Ported from lineage-sdk lineage-24.0 sdk/src/java/org/lineageos/internal/statusbar.

